  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/07/IMG_1598.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">Unas 700 personas se han dado cita la noche de este viernes en la pista deportiva del Arrabal del Castillo, en Onda, para la tradicional cena de las fiestas. Un inoportuno chaparr&oacute;n no ha impedido que continuara la marcha.</span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparravalcastell14/img_1583.jpg\" alt=\"img_1583\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparravalcastell14/img_1585.jpg\" alt=\"img_1585\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparravalcastell14/img_1586.jpg\" alt=\"img_1586\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparravalcastell14/img_1587.jpg\" alt=\"img_1587\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparravalcastell14/img_1588.jpg\" alt=\"img_1588\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparravalcastell14/img_1589.jpg\" alt=\"img_1589\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparravalcastell14/img_1590.jpg\" alt=\"img_1590\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparravalcastell14/img_1591.jpg\" alt=\"img_1591\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparravalcastell14/img_1592.jpg\" alt=\"img_1592\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https:/